## Claude Desktop Buddy protocol compatibility

This project implements compatibility with the public Hardware Buddy BLE wire protocol
documented by Anthropic in [`anthropics/claude-desktop-buddy`](https://github.com/anthropics/claude-desktop-buddy).

The BLE/runtime implementation was written against that public protocol reference using
ESP-IDF APIs. The programmatic pixel sprites are original implementations informed by the
public species names and behavior. No upstream character renderer, GIF, or raster artwork
is included in the firmware.

