The IMA ADPCM implementation retains the FoloToy MIT notice at
third_party/xiabill-ai-passport-LICENSE. Runtime dependencies retain their own
licenses; this repository does not redistribute VB-CABLE, Doubao or Frida binaries.

The Windows compatibility investigation consulted
https://github.com/miaomiaozii/windows-remote-mic-app (GPL-3.0-only), especially its
report that Doubao filters injected keyboard events. No source files from that
repository are vendored here. Our callback address was located in the installed
Doubao build; the adapter limits changes to Passport-marked event copies and
checks that executable's exact hash. This attribution does not relicense the
reference project.
